WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.114
In Plan, choose New service.

2
00:00:04.214 --> 00:00:12.426
Press the slash key and type a song title, or a verse like John 3:16, then press Enter.

3
00:00:12.526 --> 00:00:15.845
It lands in the order of service.

4
00:00:15.945 --> 00:00:18.677
Drag items to reorder them.

5
00:00:18.777 --> 00:00:21.422
When you are ready, choose Open for live.
